{"agency_id": "network-for-learning", "canonical_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/managed-network-upgrade-its-time/#comment-361", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:43:22+00:00", "content": "Comment on Managed Network Upgrade: It’s time by N4L\n\nIn reply to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.n4l.co.nz/managed-network-upgrade-its-time/#comment-356&quot;&gt;Dave Winter&lt;/a&gt;.\n\nDave! Apologies for the delayed response. Would you believe we&#039;re flat out at the moment.\n\nWe&#039;re pretty excited too and we&#039;re really looking forward to sharing more information in the coming weeks - including a dedicated &#039;Under the Hood&#039; FAQs section on our website (it&#039;s like you read our mind). \n\nWe&#039;re unlocking plenty of our old limitations with this upgrade - so watch this space...\n\nIn the meantime - if you want to have a quick chat feel free to give us a call on 0800 LEARNING.", "content_hash": "63b03ed28ed8eb202196361555518a152ee6aba3366d1054eb65d596e154f711", "cross_source_ids": {"source_id": "network-for-learning-rss-9a714e3d"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_rss_feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2018-08-09T05:17:10+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\rss\\2018-08\\dc7105e7f1b0a3919f94c580.json", "record_id": "rss:dc7105e7f1b0a3919f94c580", "source_account": "https://www.n4l.co.nz", "source_kind": "rss_feed", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/comments/feed/"}
{"agency_id": "network-for-learning", "canonical_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/managed-network-upgrade-its-time/#comment-356", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:43:22+00:00", "content": "Comment on Managed Network Upgrade: It’s time by Dave Winter\n\nHey team n4l -- E X C I T I N G -- we are all looking forward to this in the Manaiakalani and outreach schools. One thing I am particularly interested in understanding is how the filtering/reporting will work at an individual level. The Cisco Websense enviroment had limitation for google schools in that they had to be using active directory sync to have individual level info available. Is there a chance to peek under the fortigate hood any time soon? Another Bog post ? ;-) . Thanks for this step up Mucho Gracias", "content_hash": "c7e92ea1818f797927e00b361bb5c0c6d3a82cd374b997028d5753b0d9f19500", "cross_source_ids": {"source_id": "network-for-learning-rss-9a714e3d"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_rss_feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2018-08-02T22:10:18+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\rss\\2018-08\\268812d17e70683c702cabf1.json", "record_id": "rss:268812d17e70683c702cabf1", "source_account": "https://www.n4l.co.nz", "source_kind": "rss_feed", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/comments/feed/"}
